-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"KFY 2020 Q2","e":"kfy","d":"2019-12-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert Rozek","x":"The annual cost savings in KF Digital associated with these actions is estimated to be $25 million to $30 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/12/06/korn-ferry-kfy-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"KFY 2020 Q3","e":"kfy","d":"2020-03-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Gary D. Burnison","x":"In other words, you haven't seen across the board cost cutting along with job eliminations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/03/10/korn-ferry-kfy-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"KFY 2020 Q3","e":"kfy","d":"2020-03-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Gary D. Burnison","x":"…significantly increased scale and the stronger financial position will allow us to withstand a near-term revenue decline that similar to what we experienced back in SARS and maintained a 10% to 11% adjusted EBITDA margin on a trailing 12 basis without taking any restructuring actions by the way.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/03/10/korn-ferry-kfy-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"KFY 2020 Q4","e":"kfy","d":"2020-07-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Gary D. Burnison","x":"…whether it's how they deal with customers virtually, whether it's how they improve sales effectiveness virtually, whether it's M&A, restructuring, all of those things play into Korn Ferry platform today, which is substantially different than 12 years, 13 years ago in the Great Recession.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/02/korn-ferry-kfy-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"KFY 2020 Q4","e":"kfy","d":"2020-07-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Gary D. Burnison","x":"And you'll see when we unfortunately had to rightsize our workforce, we were very purposeful in how we did that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/02/korn-ferry-kfy-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"KFY 2021 Q1","e":"kfy","d":"2020-09-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert Rozek","x":"Excluding amounts reserved for deferred comp and for accrued bonuses and actually net of the funds used to rightsize the firms, our investable cash balance at the end of the first quarter was about $511 million, and that's up about $150 million year-over-year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/09/03/korn-ferry-kfy-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KFY 2021 Q1","e":"kfy","d":"2020-09-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert Rozek","x":"Finally, during the quarter, we completed our restructuring actions to size the firm for the anticipated current levels of revenue.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/09/03/korn-ferry-kfy-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KFY 2021 Q2","e":"kfy","d":"2020-11-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert Rozek","x":"More importantly, as fee revenue has improved, we've been able to drive higher earnings of profitability by leveraging the cost-saving actions we recently put in place, as well as the productivity and cost efficiencies resulting from our emerging digital and virtual delivery processes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/23/korn-ferry-kfy-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KFY 2021 Q2","e":"kfy","d":"2020-11-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert Rozek","x":"Finally, during the last couple of quarters, we have discussed a number of restructuring and cost-saving initiatives designed to help the Firm through the trough of the COVID-19 crisis.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/23/korn-ferry-kfy-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KFY 2022 Q2","e":"kfy","d":"2021-12-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Gary Burnison","x":"We've also raised prices across the board, whether it's our Consulting business or Digital businesses, we've had to increase our price points.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/12/08/korn-ferry-kfy-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KFY 2022 Q2","e":"kfy","d":"2021-12-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Gary Burnison","x":"So, I think that we are taking a balanced approach to making sure that we are being rewarded for the value that we deliver to clients and also passing that on to, not only our shareholders, but as importantly, our colleagues.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/12/08/korn-ferry-kfy-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KFY 2022 Q3","e":"kfy","d":"2022-03-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Gary Burnison","x":"And that's a question that if that were to continue, at some point, companies are not able to pass that on to consumers which does impact earnings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/03/09/kornferry-international-kfy-q3-2022-earnings-call/"},{"c":"KFY 2022 Q3","e":"kfy","d":"2022-03-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Marc Riddick","x":"I was wondering if you could talk a little bit about the recurring revenue and subscription revenue that as far as specifically to price increases around those types of services, whether or not you're seeing much in the way of -- it doesn't seem as though there's much pushback.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/03/09/kornferry-international-kfy-q3-2022-earnings-call/"},{"c":"KFY 2022 Q4","e":"kfy","d":"2022-06-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jasper Bibb","x":"I was kind of thinking of some of the headlines around tech companies, instituting hiring freezes or doing layoffs and I was wondering if that was having any impact here.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/06/22/kornferry-international-kfy-q4-2022-earnings-call/"},{"c":"KFY 2026 Q3","e":"kfy","d":"2026-03-09","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Trevor Romeo","x":"Now that you have it in place up and running in addition to your other sort of tech and AI investments, how do you view Korn Ferry's technology spending, I guess, in total in the next few years, whether that's CapEx or OpEx?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/09/korn-ferry-kfy-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KFY 2026 Q3","e":"kfy","d":"2026-03-09","l":"ai_disruption","r":"analyst","s":"Gary Burnison","x":"As I reflect on all the recent conversations surrounding AI and disintermediation, it strikes me that the question isn't simply will AI take away jobs?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/09/korn-ferry-kfy-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KFY 2027 Q1","e":"kfy","d":"2026-09-09","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Gary D. Burnison","x":"If they are not building data centers or in the AI area.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/09/09/korn-ferry-kfy-q1-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[33,1,7106,0,0,0,5706,658],[35,1,6645,0,0,0,4891,1040],[36,1,7360,0,0,0,5892,804],[37,1,7197,0,0,0,5416,1089],[38,1,8149,0,0,0,5884,1522],[39,1,6318,0,0,0,5116,579],[40,1,10087,0,0,0,7688,1578],[42,2,15887,0,0,0,12577,2037],[43,1,9766,0,0,0,7713,1328],[44,1,7103,0,0,0,5523,916],[45,1,8006,0,0,0,6048,1272],[46,1,8002,0,0,0,3008,4298],[47,1,7197,0,0,0,5686,854],[48,1,7027,0,0,0,5411,959],[49,1,7210,0,0,0,5969,658],[50,1,7154,0,0,0,5450,1070],[64,1,6726,0,0,0,1376,4766],[66,1,6492,0,0,0,1521,4340]],"cinema":[[33,1,7106,0,0,0,5706,658],[35,1,6645,0,0,0,4891,1040],[36,1,7360,0,0,0,5892,804],[37,1,7197,0,0,0,5416,1089],[38,1,8149,0,0,0,5884,1522],[39,1,6318,0,0,0,5116,579],[40,1,10087,0,0,0,7688,1578],[42,2,15887,0,0,0,12577,2037],[43,1,9766,0,0,0,7713,1328],[44,1,7103,0,0,0,5523,916],[45,1,8006,0,0,0,6048,1272],[46,1,8002,0,0,0,3008,4298],[47,1,7197,0,0,0,5686,854],[48,1,7027,0,0,0,5411,959],[49,1,7210,0,0,0,5969,658],[50,1,7154,0,0,0,5450,1070],[64,1,6726,0,0,0,137